    <briefdescription>
<para>fixed width, padded column index representation of a matrix (ELLPACK format) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every row stores <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1EllSparsityPattern_1a79352612b79ac543ef5552180ea3a7b0" kindref="member">numStoredElementsPerRow()</ref> column indices, the width of the widest row, padding the shorter rows with invalidIndex(). The slots are stored column major, slot s of row i at i + <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1EllSparsityPattern_1a612112caa329c21077141cd9bef000c2" kindref="member">stride()</ref> * s, so that one thread per row accesses memory coalesced. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
